00:22:28.599 --> 00:22:32.308
<v obi-wan>Can you see him?</v>
<v anakin>I think he is a she,</v>

207
00:22:32.686 --> 00:22:34.222
<v anakin>and I think she is a changeling.</v>

208
00:22:35.731 --> 00:22:38.188
<v obi-wan>In that case, be extra careful.</v>

209
00:22:40.235 --> 00:22:42.851
<v obi-wan>Go and find her.</v>
<v anakin>Where are you going, master?</v>

210
00:22:43.113 --> 00:22:44.319
<v obi-wan>For a drink.</v>

211
00:22:55.125 --> 00:22:56.456
<v obi-wan>Thank you.</v>

212
00:22:58.003 --> 00:22:59.288
<v role-server>You wanna buy some death sticks?</v>

213
00:22:59.379 --> 00:23:01.165
<v obi-wan>You don't want to sell me death sticks.</v>

214
00:23:01.256 --> 00:23:02.996
<v role-server>I don't want to sell you death sticks.</v>

215
00:23:03.091 --> 00:23:04.611
<v obi-wan>You want to go home and rethink your life.</v>

216
00:23:04.635 --> 00:23:07.217
<v role-server>I want to go home and rethink my life.</v>

217
00:23:55.978 --> 00:24:00.347
<v anakin>Easy. Jedi business. Go back to your drinks.</v>

218
00:24:05.988 --> 00:24:08.320
<v obi-wan>Do you know who it was you were trying to kill?</v>

219
00:24:09.366 --> 00:24:10.947
<v zam-wesell>It was a senator from Naboo.</v>

220
00:24:11.034 --> 00:24:12.945
<v obi-wan>And who hired you?</v>

221
00:24:13.036 --> 00:24:14.036
<v zam-wesell>It was just a job.</v>

222
00:24:14.955 --> 00:24:17.241
<v anakin>Who hired you? Tell us.</v>

223
00:24:19.167 --> 00:24:20.873
<v anakin>Tell us now!</v>

224
00:24:21.878 --> 00:24:23.493
<v zam-wesell>It was a bounty hunter called...</v>

225
00:24:42.733 --> 00:24:44.724
<v obi-wan>Toxic dart.</v>

226
00:24:55.078 --> 00:24:59.196
<v yoda>Track down this bounty hunter you must, Obi-Wan.</v>

227
00:24:59.416 --> 00:25:02.829
<v mace-windu>Most importantly, find out who he's working for.</v>

228
00:25:02.919 --> 00:25:04.534
<v obi-wan>What about senator Amidala?</v>

229
00:25:04.629 --> 00:25:06.915
<v obi-wan>She will still need protecting.</v>

230
00:25:07.424 --> 00:25:10.382
<v yoda>Handle that your padawan will.</v>

231
00:25:11.762 --> 00:25:15.175
<v mace-windu>Anakin, escort the senator back to her home planet of Naboo.</v>

232
00:25:15.265 --> 00:25:19.099
<v mace-windu>She'll be safer there. And don't use registered transport.</v>

233
00:25:19.186 --> 00:25:21.302
<v mace-windu>Travel as refugees.</v>

234
00:25:21.521 --> 00:25:23.807
<v anakin>As the leader of the opposition, it will be very difficult</v>

235
00:25:23.899 --> 00:25:26.641
<v anakin>to get senator Amidala to leave the capital.</v>

236
00:25:27.402 --> 00:25:30.360
<v yoda>Until caught this killer is,</v>

237
00:25:30.447 --> 00:25:33.814
<v yoda>our judgment she must respect.</v>

238
00:25:33.909 --> 00:25:36.275
<v mace-windu>Anakin, go to the senate</v>

239
00:25:36.369 --> 00:25:39.361
<v mace-windu>and ask chancellor palpatine to speak with her about this matter.</v>

240
00:25:48.632 --> 00:25:53.376
<v palpatine>I will talk with her. Senator Amidala will not refuse an executive order.</v>

241
00:25:53.470 --> 00:25:55.836
<v palpatine>I know her well enough to assure you of that,</v>

242
00:25:56.139 --> 00:25:58.130
<v anakin>thank you, your excellency.</v>

243
00:25:58.225 --> 00:26:02.343
<v palpatine>And so, they've finally given you an assignment.</v>

244
00:26:02.437 --> 00:26:04.519
<v palpatine>Your Patience has paid off.</v>

245
00:26:04.606 --> 00:26:08.190
<v anakin>Your guidance more than my Patience.</v>

246
00:26:08.276 --> 00:26:11.359
<v palpatine>You don't need guidance, Anakin.</v>

247
00:26:11.446 --> 00:26:15.109
<v palpatine>In time, you will learn to trust your feelings.</v>

248
00:26:16.451 --> 00:26:18.908
<v palpatine>Then you will be invincible.</v>

249
00:26:21.790 --> 00:26:24.156
<v palpatine>I have said it many times.</v>

250
00:26:24.251 --> 00:26:26.993
<v palpatine>You are the most gifted jedi I have ever met.</v>

251
00:26:27.087 --> 00:26:28.418
<v anakin>Thank you, your excellency.</v>

252
00:26:28.505 --> 00:26:32.214
<v palpatine>I see you becoming the greatest of all the jedi, Anakin,</v>

253
00:26:32.300 --> 00:26:35.212
<v palpatine>even more powerful than master Yoda.</v>

254
00:26:40.267 --> 00:26:42.303
<v obi-wan>I am concerned for my padawan.</v>

255
00:26:42.394 --> 00:26:45.136
<v obi-wan>He is not ready to be given this assignment on his own yet.</v>

256
00:26:45.230 --> 00:26:48.222
<v yoda>The council is confident in its decision, Obi-Wan.</v>

257
00:26:48.316 --> 00:26:50.272
<v mace-windu>The boy has exceptional skills.</v>

258
00:26:50.360 --> 00:26:53.067
<v obi-wan>But he still has much to learn, master.</v>

259
00:26:53.155 --> 00:26:56.613
<v obi-wan>His abilities have made him, well, arrogant.</v>

260
00:26:56.700 --> 00:26:58.736
Yes, yes.

261
00:26:58.827 --> 00:27:01.944
<v yoda>A flaw more and more common among jedi.</v>

262
00:27:03.582 --> 00:27:06.449
<v yoda>Too sure of themselves they are.</v>

263
00:27:06.543 --> 00:27:09.956
<v yoda>Even the older, more experienced ones.</v>

264
00:27:10.547 --> 00:27:13.539
<v mace-windu>Remember, Obi-Wan, if the prophecy is true,</v>

265
00:27:13.633 --> 00:27:14.964
<v mace-windu>your apprentice is the only one</v>

266
00:27:15.051 --> 00:27:17.508
<v mace-windu>who can bring the force back into balance.</v>

267
00:27:21.558 --> 00:27:24.174
<v padme>I'm taking an extended leave of absence.</v>

268
00:27:24.269 --> 00:27:27.477
<v padme>It will be your responsibility to take my place in the senate.</v>

269
00:27:27.564 --> 00:27:29.350
<v padme>Representative binks... hmm?</v>

270
00:27:29.441 --> 00:27:30.481
<v padme>I know I can count on you.</v>

271
00:27:31.151 --> 00:27:35.394
<v jar-jar>Mesa honored to be taking on dissa heavy burden.</v>

272
00:27:35.488 --> 00:27:39.777
<v jar-jar>Mesa accept this with muy, muy humility and...</v>

273
00:27:39.868 --> 00:27:42.860
<v padme>Jar jar, I don't wish to hold you up.</v>

274
00:27:42.954 --> 00:27:44.444
<v padme>I'm sure you have a great deal to do.</v>

275
00:27:44.873 --> 00:27:47.865
<v jar-jar>Of course. Milady.</v>

276
00:27:53.173 --> 00:27:54.879
<v padme>I do not like this idea of hiding.</v>

277
00:27:55.592 --> 00:27:56.877
<v anakin>Don't worry.</v>

278
00:27:56.968 --> 00:27:59.004
<v anakin>Now that the council has ordered an investigation,</v>

279
00:27:59.095 --> 00:28:01.711
<v anakin>it won't take master Obi-Wan long to find this bounty hunter.</v>

280
00:28:01.806 --> 00:28:04.889
<v padme>I haven't worked for a year to defeat the military creation act</v>

281
00:28:04.976 --> 00:28:07.308
<v padme>to not be here when its fate is decided.</v>

282
00:28:07.395 --> 00:28:11.354
<v anakin>Sometimes we must let go of our pride and do what is requested of us.</v>

283
00:28:11.441 --> 00:28:14.979
<v padme>Anakin, you've grown up.</v>

284
00:28:16.613 --> 00:28:19.480
<v anakin>Master Obi-Wan manages not to see it.</v>

285
00:28:25.455 --> 00:28:30.449
<v anakin>Don't get me wrong. Obi-Wan is a great mentor.</v>

286
00:28:30.543 --> 00:28:35.333
<v anakin>As wise as master Yoda and as powerful as master wind...</v>

287
00:28:37.509 --> 00:28:40.125
<v anakin>I am truly thankful to be his apprentice.</v>

288
00:28:42.639 --> 00:28:45.881
<v anakin>In some ways, a lot of ways,</v>

289
00:28:47.185 --> 00:28:49.176
<v anakin>I'm really ahead of him.</v>

290
00:28:50.021 --> 00:28:51.852
<v anakin>I'm ready for the trials,</v>

291
00:28:52.524 --> 00:28:55.561
<v anakin>but he feels that I'm too unpredictable.</v>

292
00:28:55.652 --> 00:28:57.608
<v anakin>He won't let me move on.</v>

293
00:28:57.988 --> 00:29:00.445
<v padme>That must be frustrating. =lt's worse.</v>

294
00:29:00.532 --> 00:29:03.365
<v anakin>He's overly critical. He never listens.</v>

295
00:29:03.451 --> 00:29:05.567
<v anakin>He doesn't understand.</v>

296
00:29:05.662 --> 00:29:08.199
<v anakin>It's not fair!</v>

297
00:29:08.832 --> 00:29:13.201
<v padme>All mentors have a way of seeing more of our faults than we would like.</v>

298
00:29:13.295 --> 00:29:15.286
<v padme>It's the only way we grow.</v>

299
00:29:16.214 --> 00:29:19.627
<v anakin>(Sighs) I know.</v>

300
00:29:20.135 --> 00:29:22.217
<v padme>Anakin.</v>

301
00:29:24.055 --> 00:29:26.467
<v padme>Don't try to grow up too fast.</v>

302
00:29:26.933 --> 00:29:29.049
<v anakin>But I am grown up.</v>

303
00:29:30.687 --> 00:29:33.019
<v anakin>You said it yourself.</v>

304
00:29:34.232 --> 00:29:36.097
<v padme>Please don't look at me like that.</v>

305
00:29:37.319 --> 00:29:40.652
<v anakin>Why not?</v>
<v padme>It makes me feel uncomfortable.</v>

306
00:29:42.907 --> 00:29:44.898
<v anakin>Sorry, milady.</v>

307
00:30:00.342 --> 00:30:02.708
<v typho>Be safe, milady.</v>
<v padme>Thank you, captain.</v>

308
00:30:02.802 --> 00:30:05.885
<v padme>Take good care of dorme. The threat's on you two now.</v>

309
00:30:06.306 --> 00:30:08.297
<v dorme>He'll be safe with me.</v>

310
00:30:12.729 --> 00:30:15.596
<v padme>You'll be fine.</v>
<v dorme>It's not me, milady.</v>

311
00:30:15.690 --> 00:30:19.774
<v dorme>I worry about you. What if they realize you've left the capital?</v>

312
00:30:20.820 --> 00:30:24.404
<v padme>Well, then my jedi protector will have to prove how good he is.</v>

313
00:30:24.574 --> 00:30:26.110
<v obi-wan>Anakin.</v>

314
00:30:26.201 --> 00:30:29.568
Don't do anything without first consulting either myself or the council.

315
00:30:30.163 --> 00:30:31.824
<v anakin>Yes, master.</v>

316
00:30:32.540 --> 00:30:35.452
<v obi-wan>I'll get to the bottom of this plot quickly, milady.</v>

317
00:30:35.543 --> 00:30:37.283
<v obi-wan>You'll be back here in no time.</v>

318
00:30:37.462 --> 00:30:40.670
<v padme>I'll be most grateful for your speed, master jedi.</v>

319
00:30:40.757 --> 00:30:42.588
It's time to go. =I know.

320
00:30:42.926 --> 00:30:45.338
<v obi-wan>Anakin, may the force be with you.</v>

321
00:30:45.428 --> 00:30:47.669
<v anakin>May the force be with you, master.</v>

322
00:30:58.733 --> 00:31:00.644
<v padme>Suddenly I'm afraid.</v>

323
00:31:00.735 --> 00:31:04.523
<v anakin>This is my first assignment on my own. I am too.</v>

324
00:31:06.658 --> 00:31:08.398
<v anakin>Don't worry. We have r2 with us.</v>

325
00:31:14.082 --> 00:31:17.666
<v obi-wan>I do hope he doesn't try anything foolish.</v>

326
00:31:17.752 --> 00:31:21.620
<v typho>I'd be more concerned about her doing something than him.</v>

327
00:31:42.485 --> 00:31:44.601
<v role-droid>Someone to see ya, honey!</v>

328
00:31:44.696 --> 00:31:46.652
<v hermione-bagwa>Jedi, by the looks of him.</v>

329
00:31:47.699 --> 00:31:52.033
<v dexter-jettster>Obi-Wan!</v>
Hello, Dex.

330
00:31:52.745 --> 00:31:54.781
<v dexter-jettster>Take a seat. I'll be right with ya.</v>

331
00:31:57.208 --> 00:32:00.666
You wanna cup o' jawa juice?
<v obi-wan>Oh, yes. Thank you.</v>

332
00:32:03.465 --> 00:32:07.299
<v dexter-jettster>Hey, old buddy!</v>

333
00:32:16.102 --> 00:32:19.560
<v dexter-jettster>So, my friend, what can I do for ya?</v>

334
00:32:19.647 --> 00:32:21.308
<v obi-wan>You can tell me what this is.</v>

335
00:32:22.567 --> 00:32:25.604
<v dexter-jettster>Well, whattaya know!</v>

336
00:32:25.695 --> 00:32:28.528
<v dexter-jettster>I ain't seen one of these since I was prospectin'</v>

337
00:32:28.615 --> 00:32:32.278
<v dexter-jettster>on subterrel, beyond the outer rim.</v>

338
00:32:32.368 --> 00:32:34.199
<v obi-wan>Can you tell me where it came from? Thank you.</v>

339
00:32:34.287 --> 00:32:37.450
<v dexter-jettster>This baby belongs to them cloners.</v>

340
00:32:37.540 --> 00:32:41.704
<v dexter-jettster>What you got here is a kamino saberdart.</v>

341
00:32:42.212 --> 00:32:44.874
<v obi-wan>I wonder why it didn't show up in the analysis archives.</v>

342
00:32:45.048 --> 00:32:47.960
<v dexter-jettster>It's these funny little cuts on the side that give it away.</v>

343
00:32:48.051 --> 00:32:51.760
<v dexter-jettster>Those analysis droids only focus on symbols.</v>

344
00:32:51.846 --> 00:32:54.588
<v dexter-jettster>(Scofes) I should think that you jedi would have more respect</v>

345
00:32:54.682 --> 00:32:56.362
<v dexter-jettster>for the difference between knowledge and...</v>

346
00:32:56.893 --> 00:32:59.885
<v dexter-jettster>(Chuckles) Wisdom.</v>

347
00:32:59.979 --> 00:33:03.847
<v obi-wan>Well, if droids could think, there'd be none of us here, would there?</v>

348
00:33:04.859 --> 00:33:07.316
<v obi-wan>Kamino. I'm not familiar with it. Is it in the Republic?</v>

349
00:33:07.403 --> 00:33:09.314
<v dexter-jettster>No, no. It's beyond the quter rim.</v>

350
00:33:09.697 --> 00:33:14.612
<v dexter-jettster>I'd say about 12 parsecs outside the rishi maze.</v>

351
00:33:14.702 --> 00:33:18.911
<v dexter-jettster>Should be easy to find, even for those droids in your archives.</v>

352
00:33:20.375 --> 00:33:24.994
<v dexter-jettster>These kaminoans keep to themselves.</v>

353
00:33:25.088 --> 00:33:28.296
<v dexter-jettster>They're cloners. Damn good ones too.</v>

354
00:33:29.300 --> 00:33:33.259
<v obi-wan>Cloners. Are they friendly?</v>
Depends.

355
00:33:33.346 --> 00:33:34.927
Depends on what, Dex?

356
00:33:35.306 --> 00:33:37.797
<v dexter-jettster>On how good your manners are...</v>

357
00:33:37.892 --> 00:33:42.886
<v dexter-jettster>And how big your pocketbook is.</v>

358
00:33:52.782 --> 00:33:54.522
Did you call for assistance?

359
00:33:54.617 --> 00:33:55.652
Yes, yes, I did.

360
00:33:55.743 --> 00:33:57.950
Are you having a problem, master Kenobi?

361
00:33:58.037 --> 00:34:01.029
<v obi-wan>Yes, I'm looking for a planetary system called kamino.</v>

362
00:34:01.124 --> 00:34:02.124
<v obi-wan>Kamino.</v>

363
00:34:02.208 --> 00:34:03.727
It doesn't show up on the archive charts.

364
00:34:03.751 --> 00:34:07.790
Kamino. It's not a system I'm familiar with.

365
00:34:07.880 --> 00:34:10.747
Are you sure you have the right coordinates?

366
00:34:10.842 --> 00:34:13.629
According to my information, it should appear in this quadrant here,

367
00:34:13.720 --> 00:34:15.881
just south of the rishi maze.

368
00:34:22.729 --> 00:34:26.187
I hate to say it, but it looks like the system you're searching for

369
00:34:26.274 --> 00:34:27.810
doesn't exist.

370
00:34:27.900 --> 00:34:31.643
<v obi-wan>Impossible. Perhaps the archives are incomplete.</v>

371
00:34:32.071 --> 00:34:34.904
If an item does not appear in our records,

372
00:34:34.991 --> 00:34:37.528
it does not exist.

373
00:34:58.431 --> 00:35:01.013
Hey, you! No droids!

374
00:35:01.100 --> 00:35:02.840
Get outta herel

375
00:35:09.817 --> 00:35:11.603
<v padme>Thank you, r2.</v>

376
00:35:12.528 --> 00:35:15.520
<v padme>Must be difficult, having sworn your life to the jedi,</v>

377
00:35:15.615 --> 00:35:17.731
<v padme>not being able to visit the places you like</v>

378
00:35:17.825 --> 00:35:19.781
<v padme>or do the things you like.</v>

379
00:35:19.869 --> 00:35:22.030
<v anakin>Or be with the people that I love.</v>

380
00:35:22.705 --> 00:35:24.821
<v padme>Are you allowed to love?</v>

381
00:35:24.916 --> 00:35:26.872
<v padme>I thought that was forbidden for a jedi.</v>

382
00:35:29.921 --> 00:35:32.879
<v anakin>Attachment is forbidden.</v>

383
00:35:34.050 --> 00:35:35.961
<v anakin>Possession is forbidden.</v>

384
00:35:36.052 --> 00:35:39.920
<v anakin>Compassion, which I would define as unconditional love,</v>

385
00:35:40.598 --> 00:35:42.509
<v anakin>is central to a jedi's life.</v>

386
00:35:44.894 --> 00:35:49.479
<v anakin>So you might say that we are encouraged to love.</v>

387
00:35:49.899 --> 00:35:54.108
<v padme>You've changed so much.</v>
<v anakin>You haven't changed a bit.</v>

388
00:35:54.195 --> 00:35:57.062
<v anakin>You're exactly the way I remember you in my dreams.</v>

389
00:36:09.335 --> 00:36:13.294
<v yoda>Reach out. Sense the force around you.</v>

390
00:36:13.756 --> 00:36:17.044
Use your feelings you must.

391
00:36:20.430 --> 00:36:23.593
Younglings. Younglings!

392
00:36:23.683 --> 00:36:26.265
A visitor we have.

393
00:36:26.477 --> 00:36:29.219
Hello, master Obi-Wan.

394
00:36:29.605 --> 00:36:32.438
<v obi-wan>Hello. I'm sorry to disturb you, master.</v>

395
00:36:32.734 --> 00:36:36.147
<v yoda>What help can I be, Obi-Wan, hmm?</v>

396
00:36:36.320 --> 00:36:39.153
<v obi-wan>I'm looking for a planet described to me by an old friend.</v>

397
00:36:39.240 --> 00:36:42.448
<v obi-wan>I trust him, but the systems don't show on the archive maps.</v>

398
00:36:44.036 --> 00:36:46.743
<v yoda>Lost a planet master Obi-Wan has.</v>

399
00:36:46.831 --> 00:36:48.742
How embarrassing.

400
00:36:48.833 --> 00:36:51.245
How embarrassing.

401
00:36:52.462 --> 00:36:54.293
Liam, the shades.

402
00:36:55.673 --> 00:36:57.163
Gather round the map reader.

403
00:36:57.967 --> 00:36:59.423
Clear your minds

404
00:37:00.219 --> 00:37:03.962
and find Obi-Wan's wayward planet we will.

405
00:37:05.224 --> 00:37:08.637
It ought to be here,

406
00:37:08.728 --> 00:37:10.093
but it isn't.

407
00:37:10.188 --> 00:37:14.056
Gravity is pulling all the stars in the area towards this spot.

408
00:37:15.401 --> 00:37:17.687
<v yoda>Gravity's silhouette remains,</v>

409
00:37:17.779 --> 00:37:20.395
<v yoda>but the star and all the planets,</v>

410
00:37:20.490 --> 00:37:22.822
<v yoda>disappeared they have.</v>

411
00:37:22.909 --> 00:37:24.865
How can this be?

412
00:37:26.120 --> 00:37:28.156
A thought?

413
00:37:29.123 --> 00:37:32.536
Master?

414
00:37:32.794 --> 00:37:35.581
Because someone erased it from the archive memory.

415
00:37:39.258 --> 00:37:43.672
Truly wonderful the mind of a child is.

416
00:37:45.431 --> 00:37:48.138
The padawan is right.

417
00:37:48.351 --> 00:37:51.093
Go to the center of gravity's pull

418
00:37:51.437 --> 00:37:55.180
and find your planet you will.

419
00:37:59.987 --> 00:38:03.479
The data must have been erased.

420
00:38:03.574 --> 00:38:06.691
But, master Yoda, who could empty information from the archives?

421
00:38:06.786 --> 00:38:08.276
That's impossible, isn't it? I j

422
00:38:08.496 --> 00:38:11.909
dangerous and disturbing this puzzle is.

423
00:38:12.291 --> 00:38:15.909
Only a jedi could have erased those files.

424
00:38:16.003 --> 00:38:19.871
But who and why, harder to answer.

425
00:38:20.550 --> 00:38:24.088
Meditate on this I will.

426
00:38:48.202 --> 00:38:50.693
<v padme>I wasn't the youngest queen ever elected,</v>

427
00:38:50.788 --> 00:38:54.531
<v padme>but now that I think back on it, I'm not sure I was old enough.</v>

428
00:38:54.625 --> 00:38:56.331
<v padme>I'm not sure I was ready.</v>

429
00:38:56.419 --> 00:38:59.877
<v anakin>The people you served thought you did a good job.</v>

430
00:38:59.964 --> 00:39:01.775
<v anakin>I heard they even tried to amend the constitution</v>

431
00:39:01.799 --> 00:39:03.755
<v anakin>so you could stay in office.</v>

432
00:39:03.843 --> 00:39:06.585
<v padme>I was relieved when my two terms were up.</v>

433
00:39:07.179 --> 00:39:09.966
<v padme>But when the queen asked me to serve as senator,</v>

434
00:39:10.057 --> 00:39:12.469
<v padme>I couldn't refuse her:</v>

435
00:39:12.560 --> 00:39:16.303
<v anakin>I agree with her. I think the Republic needs you.</v>

436
00:39:18.065 --> 00:39:20.226
<v anakin>I'm glad that you chose to serve.</v>

437
00:39:27.241 --> 00:39:28.677
<v padme>If the senate votes to create an army,</v>

438
00:39:28.701 --> 00:39:30.692
<v padme>I'm sure it's going to push us into a civil war.</v>

439
00:39:30.786 --> 00:39:33.027
<v sio-bibble>It's unthinkable.</v>

440
00:39:33.122 --> 00:39:36.330
<v sio-bibble>There hasn't been a full-scale war since the formation of the Republic.</v>

441
00:39:37.001 --> 00:39:39.083
<v jamillia>Do you see any way through negotiations</v>

442
00:39:39.170 --> 00:39:41.126
<v jamillia>to bring the separatists back into the Republic?</v>

443
00:39:41.672 --> 00:39:43.082
<v padme>Not if they feel threatened.</v>

444
00:39:43.174 --> 00:39:45.290
<v padme>My guess is they'll turn to the trade federations</v>

445
00:39:45.384 --> 00:39:46.794
<v padme>or the commerce guilds for help.</v>

446
00:39:46.886 --> 00:39:51.220
<v sio-bibble>It's outrageous, but after four trials in the supreme court,</v>

447
00:39:51.307 --> 00:39:55.220
<v sio-bibble>nute gunray is still the viceroy of the trade federation.</v>

448
00:39:55.311 --> 00:39:59.350
I fear the senate is powerless to resolve this crisis.

449
00:40:01.192 --> 00:40:03.683
<v jamillia>We must keep our faith in the Republic.</v>

450
00:40:10.368 --> 00:40:14.657
<v jamillia>The day we stop believing democracy can work is the day we lose it.</v>

451
00:40:14.747 --> 00:40:17.113
<v padme>Let's pray that day never comes.</v>

452
00:40:17.208 --> 00:40:20.120
<v jamillia>In the meantime, we must consider your own safety.</v>

453
00:40:21.003 --> 00:40:23.244
<v sio-bibble>What is your suggestion, master jedi?</v>

454
00:40:23.631 --> 00:40:25.212
<v padme>Oh, Anakin's not a jedi yet.</v>

455
00:40:25.299 --> 00:40:27.335
<v padme>He's still a padawan learner. But I was thinking...</v>

456
00:40:27.426 --> 00:40:30.042
Hold on a minute. Excuse me.

457
00:40:30.137 --> 00:40:32.469
<v padme>I was thinking I would stay in the lake country.</v>

458
00:40:32.556 --> 00:40:34.676
<v padme>There are some places up there that are very isolated.</v>

459
00:40:34.767 --> 00:40:38.351
<v anakin>Excuse me. I'm in charge of security here, milady.</v>

460
00:40:38.771 --> 00:40:40.477
<v padme>And this is my home. I know it very well,</v>

461
00:40:40.564 --> 00:40:41.929
<v padme>that is why we're here.</v>

462
00:40:42.525 --> 00:40:43.685
<v padme>I think it would be wise</v>

463
00:40:43.776 --> 00:40:46.643
<v padme>if you took advantage of my knowledge in this instance.</v>

464
00:40:48.239 --> 00:40:49.729
<v anakin>Sorry, milady.</v>

465
00:40:52.743 --> 00:40:55.155
<v jamillia>Perfect. It's settled, then.</v>

466
00:41:09.051 --> 00:41:12.088
There it is, r4, right where it should be.

467
00:41:12.179 --> 00:41:13.715
Our missing planet kamino.

468
00:41:52.344 --> 00:41:53.800
<v taun-we>Master jedi.</v>

469
00:41:54.555 --> 00:41:57.217
<v taun-we>The prime minister is expecting you.</v>

470
00:41:58.392 --> 00:42:00.974
<v obi-wan>I'm expected?</v>
<v taun-we>Of course.</v>

471
00:42:01.604 --> 00:42:04.220
<v taun-we>He is anxious to meet you.</v>

472
00:42:04.398 --> 00:42:06.354
<v taun-we>After all these years,</v>

473
00:42:06.442 --> 00:42:09.730
<v taun-we>we were beginning to think you weren't coming.</v>

474
00:42:09.820 --> 00:42:12.311
<v taun-we>Now, please, this way.</v>

475
00:42:25.169 --> 00:42:27.501
<v taun-we>May I present lama su,</v>

476
00:42:27.588 --> 00:42:30.079
<v taun-we>prime minister of kamino.</v>

477
00:42:31.467 --> 00:42:33.753
<v taun-we>And this is master jedi...</v>

478
00:42:33.844 --> 00:42:35.800
<v obi-wan>Obi-Wan Kenobi.</v>

479
00:42:36.430 --> 00:42:39.137
<v lama-su>I trust you're going to enjoy your stay.</v>

480
00:42:40.476 --> 00:42:42.137
Please.

481
00:42:44.188 --> 00:42:46.349
<v lama-su>And now to business.</v>

482
00:42:46.440 --> 00:42:50.399
<v lama-su>You will be delighted to hear that we are on schedule.</v>

483
00:42:51.654 --> 00:42:53.485
<v lama-su>200,000 units are ready,</v>

484
00:42:53.572 --> 00:42:56.109
<v lama-su>with a million more well on the way.</v>

485
00:42:56.742 --> 00:42:59.199
<v obi-wan>That's good news.</v>

486
00:42:59.453 --> 00:43:02.195
<v lama-su>Please tell your master sifo-dyas</v>

487
00:43:02.289 --> 00:43:05.656
<v lama-su>that his order will be met on time.</v>

488
00:43:05.918 --> 00:43:07.874
<v obi-wan>I'm sorry. Master...</v>

489
00:43:08.879 --> 00:43:13.339
<v lama-su>Jedi master sifo-dyas is still a leading member of the jedi council,</v>

490
00:43:13.425 --> 00:43:14.881
<v lama-su>is he not?</v>

491
00:43:14.969 --> 00:43:18.757
Master sifo-dyas was killed almost ten years ago.

492
00:43:19.431 --> 00:43:22.764
Oh. I'm so sorry to hear that.

493
00:43:23.060 --> 00:43:27.224
But I'm sure he would have been proud of the army we've built for him.

494
00:43:27.815 --> 00:43:30.477
The army? Yes.

495
00:43:30.568 --> 00:43:35.653
A clone army, and I must say, one of the finest we've ever created.

496
00:43:36.198 --> 00:43:37.358
Tell me, prime minister,

497
00:43:37.449 --> 00:43:40.282
when my master first contacted you about the army,

498
00:43:40.369 --> 00:43:42.530
did he say who it was for?

499
00:43:42.788 --> 00:43:44.324
Of course he did.

500
00:43:44.415 --> 00:43:47.407
This army is for the Republic.

501
00:43:48.377 --> 00:43:52.495
<v lama-su>But you must be anxious to inspect the units for yourself.</v>

502
00:43:53.382 --> 00:43:55.498
<v obi-wan>That's why I'm here.</v>

503
00:44:16.322 --> 00:44:18.608
<v padme>We used to come here for school retreat.</v>

504
00:44:19.950 --> 00:44:22.657
<v padme>We would swim to that island every day.</v>

505
00:44:23.537 --> 00:44:25.528
<v padme>I love the water.</v>

506
00:44:30.294 --> 00:44:34.287
<v padme>We used to lie out on the sand and let the sun dry us</v>

507
00:44:34.381 --> 00:44:37.418
<v padme>and try to guess the names of the birds singing.</v>

508
00:44:40.346 --> 00:44:42.428
<v anakin>I don't like sand.</v>

509
00:44:42.806 --> 00:44:46.799
<v anakin>It's coarse and rough and irritating,</v>

510
00:44:46.894 --> 00:44:48.885
<v anakin>and it gets everywhere.</v>

511
00:44:51.315 --> 00:44:53.351
<v anakin>Not like here.</v>

512
00:44:54.068 --> 00:44:56.275
<v anakin>Here, everything is soft...</v>

513
00:44:58.072 --> 00:44:59.653
<v anakin>And smooth.</v>

514
00:45:36.860 --> 00:45:38.475
<v padme>(Music fades) =no.</v>

515
00:45:39.238 --> 00:45:41.274
<v padme>I shouldn't have done that.</v>

516
00:45:42.741 --> 00:45:44.732
<v anakin>I'm sorry.</v>

517
00:45:58.590 --> 00:46:02.458
Very impressive.
I'd hoped you would be pleased.

518
00:46:05.597 --> 00:46:07.838
Clones can think creatively.

519
00:46:07.933 --> 00:46:12.427
You will find that they are immensely superior to droids.

520
00:46:15.816 --> 00:46:21.027
We take great pride in our combat education and training programs.

521
00:46:21.113 --> 00:46:24.856
This group was created about five years ago.

522
00:46:25.034 --> 00:46:27.025
<v obi-wan>You mentioned growth acceleration.</v>

523
00:46:27.119 --> 00:46:28.700
<v lama-su>Oh, yes, it's essential.</v>

524
00:46:28.787 --> 00:46:32.120
Otherwise, a mature clone would take a lifetime to grow.

525
00:46:32.207 --> 00:46:34.789
Now we can do it in half the time.

526
00:46:35.085 --> 00:46:37.576
<v obi-wan>I see.</v>

527
00:46:37.671 --> 00:46:39.582
<v lama-su>They are totally obedient,</v>

528
00:46:39.673 --> 00:46:42.380
taking any order without question.

529
00:46:42.468 --> 00:46:44.550
We modified their genetic structure

530
00:46:44.636 --> 00:46:48.003
to make them less independent than the original host.

531
00:46:48.515 --> 00:46:50.506
And who was the original host?

532
00:46:50.601 --> 00:46:52.808
A bounty hunter called jango fett.

533
00:46:54.021 --> 00:46:56.353
And where is this bounty hunter now?

534
00:46:56.440 --> 00:46:59.022
Oh, we keep him here.

535
00:47:00.944 --> 00:47:04.186
Apart from his pay, which is considerable,

536
00:47:04.448 --> 00:47:06.530
fett demanded only one thing,

537
00:47:06.617 --> 00:47:09.450
an unaltered clone for himself.

538
00:47:09.536 --> 00:47:11.993
Curious, isn't it? Unaltered"?

539
00:47:12.706 --> 00:47:14.617
<v lama-su>Pure genetic replication.</v>

540
00:47:14.708 --> 00:47:17.666
No tampering with the structure to make it more docile

541
00:47:17.753 --> 00:47:20.745
and no growth acceleration.

542
00:47:20.839 --> 00:47:23.706
I should very much like to meet this jango fett.

543
00:47:23.801 --> 00:47:27.589
I would be very happy to arrange it for you.

544
00:47:45.155 --> 00:47:48.363
<v anakin>Magnificent, aren't they?</v>

545
00:47:54.331 --> 00:47:56.538
<v padme>I don't know.</v>

546
00:47:56.625 --> 00:47:58.786
<v anakin>Sure you do. You just don't want to tell me.</v>

547
00:47:58.877 --> 00:48:01.493
<v padme>You gonna use one of your jedi mind tricks on me?</v>

548
00:48:01.588 --> 00:48:03.749
<v anakin>They only work on the weak-minded.</v>

549
00:48:05.175 --> 00:48:08.258
<v padme>All right. I was 12.</v>

550
00:48:08.345 --> 00:48:11.678
<v padme>His name was palo. We were both in the legislative youth program.</v>

551
00:48:11.765 --> 00:48:14.598
<v padme>He was a few years older than I. Very cute.</v>

552
00:48:14.685 --> 00:48:17.347
<v padme>Dark, curly hair. Dreamy eyes.</v>

553
00:48:17.438 --> 00:48:19.770
<v anakin>All right, I get the picture.</v>

554
00:48:19.857 --> 00:48:21.688
<v anakin>Whatever happened to him?</v>

555
00:48:21.775 --> 00:48:24.733
<v padme>I went into public service, he went on to become an artist.</v>

556
00:48:24.820 --> 00:48:26.731
<v anakin>Maybe he was the smart one.</v>

557
00:48:26.822 --> 00:48:28.778
<v padme>You really don't like politicians, do you?</v>

558
00:48:28.866 --> 00:48:31.278
<v anakin>I like two or three,</v>

559
00:48:31.368 --> 00:48:33.450
<v anakin>but I'm not really sure about one of them.</v>

560
00:48:37.416 --> 00:48:39.657
<v anakin>I don't think the system works.</v>

561
00:48:39.751 --> 00:48:42.538
<v padme>How would you have it work?</v>

562
00:48:47.217 --> 00:48:51.506
<v anakin>agree what's in the best interest of all the people, and then do it.</v>

563
00:48:51.597 --> 00:48:53.087
<v padme>That's exactly what we do.</v>

564
00:48:53.182 --> 00:48:55.639
<v padme>The trouble is that people don't always agree.</v>

565
00:48:56.185 --> 00:48:57.721
<v anakin>Well, then they should be made to.</v>

566
00:48:58.061 --> 00:48:59.642
<v padme>By whom? Who's gonna make them?</v>

567
00:48:59.730 --> 00:49:01.721
<v anakin>I don't know. Someone. You?</v>

568
00:49:01.815 --> 00:49:04.352
Of course not me. But someone.

569
00:49:04.443 --> 00:49:06.183
<v anakin>Someone wise.</v>

570
00:49:06.737 --> 00:49:10.070
<v padme>Sounds an awful lot like a dictatorship to me.</v>

571
00:49:11.366 --> 00:49:14.073
<v anakin>Well, if it works.</v>

572
00:49:20.667 --> 00:49:22.658
<v padme>You're making fun of me. =no.</v>

573
00:49:22.753 --> 00:49:25.620
<v anakin>I'd be much too frightened to tease a senator.</v>

574
00:49:45.400 --> 00:49:46.400
<v anakin>Whoa.</v>

575
00:50:04.795 --> 00:50:06.877
<v padme>Anil ani, are you all right?</v>

576
00:50:43.417 --> 00:50:46.375
<v taun-we>Boba, is your father here?</v>

577
00:50:47.379 --> 00:50:48.459
<v boba-fett>Yep.</v>

578
00:50:49.089 --> 00:50:50.625
<v taun-we>May we see him?</v>

579
00:50:51.216 --> 00:50:52.547
<v boba-fett>Sure.</v>

580
00:50:54.970 --> 00:50:57.757
<v boba-fett>Dad, taun we's here.</v>

581
00:51:10.277 --> 00:51:12.768
<v taun-we>Jango, welcome back.</v>

582
00:51:12.863 --> 00:51:15.024
<v taun-we>Was your trip productive?</v>

583
00:51:15.115 --> 00:51:17.197
<v jango-fett>Fairly.</v>

584
00:51:17.284 --> 00:51:20.776
<v taun-we>This is jedi master Obi-Wan Kenobi.</v>

585
00:51:20.871 --> 00:51:24.113
<v taun-we>He's come to check on our progress.</v>

586
00:51:24.207 --> 00:51:27.244
<v obi-wan>Your clones are very impressive. You must be very proud.</v>

587
00:51:27.836 --> 00:51:30.418
<v jango-fett>I'm just a simple man trying to make my way in the universe.</v>

588
00:51:30.839 --> 00:51:34.172
<v obi-wan>Ever made your way as far into the interior as coruscant?</v>

589
00:51:35.010 --> 00:51:37.126
<v jango-fett>Once or twice.</v>
<v obi-wan>Recently?</v>

590
00:51:38.889 --> 00:51:40.845
<v jango-fett>Possibly.</v>

591
00:51:40.932 --> 00:51:43.594
<v obi-wan>Then you must know master sifo-dyas.</v>

592
00:51:51.526 --> 00:51:52.526
<v jango-fett>(In english) Master who?</v>

593
00:51:54.112 --> 00:51:56.649
<v obi-wan>Sifo-dyas.</v>

594
00:51:56.740 --> 00:51:59.402
<v obi-wan>Is he not the jedi who hired you for this job?</v>

595
00:52:02.496 --> 00:52:04.032
<v jango-fett>Never heard of him.</v>

596
00:52:07.292 --> 00:52:08.782
<v obi-wan>Really?</v>

597
00:52:08.877 --> 00:52:13.120
<v jango-fett>I was recruited by a man called tyranus on one of the moons of bogden.</v>

598
00:52:13.215 --> 00:52:14.955
<v obi-wan>Curious.</v>

599
00:52:18.845 --> 00:52:20.051
<v jango-fett>Do you like your army?</v>

600
00:52:21.890 --> 00:52:23.926
<v obi-wan>I look forward to seeing them in action.</v>

601
00:52:24.893 --> 00:52:28.727
<v jango-fett>They'll do their job well. I'll guarantee that.</v>

602
00:52:29.189 --> 00:52:31.646
<v obi-wan>Thank you for your time, jango.</v>

603
00:52:33.026 --> 00:52:34.766
<v jango-fett>Always a pleasure to meet a jedi. Vs a [I</v>

604
00:52:53.880 --> 00:52:55.871
<v boba-fett>What is it, dad?</v>

605
00:52:57.384 --> 00:52:59.921
<v jango-fett>Pack your things. We're leaving.</v>

606
00:53:04.808 --> 00:53:08.801
<v anakin>And when I got to them, we went into aggressive negotiations. Thank you.</v>

607
00:53:08.895 --> 00:53:11.477
<v padme>"Aggressive negotiations™? What's that?</v>

608
00:53:11.565 --> 00:53:14.648
<v anakin>Well, negotiations with a lightsaber.</v>

609
00:53:27.581 --> 00:53:31.290
<v anakin>If master Obi-Wan caught me doing this, he'd be very grumpy.</v>

610
00:54:00.739 --> 00:54:03.105
<v anakin>From the moment I met you,</v>

611
00:54:03.200 --> 00:54:05.987
<v anakin>all those years ago,</v>

612
00:54:06.077 --> 00:54:09.365
<v anakin>not a day has gone by when I haven't thought of you.</v>

613
00:54:11.875 --> 00:54:14.833
<v anakin>And now that I'm with you again,</v>

614
00:54:14.920 --> 00:54:16.956
<v anakin>I'm in agony.</v>

615
00:54:20.091 --> 00:54:23.959
<v anakin>The closer I get to you, the worse it gets.</v>

616
00:54:24.054 --> 00:54:27.012
<v anakin>The thought of not being with you,</v>

617
00:54:27.682 --> 00:54:30.048
<v anakin>I can't breathe.</v>

618
00:54:33.605 --> 00:54:39.020
<v anakin>I'm haunted by the kiss that you should never have given me.</v>

619
00:54:39.110 --> 00:54:41.226
<v anakin>My heart is beating,</v>

620
00:54:41.446 --> 00:54:44.438
<v anakin>hoping that that kiss will not become a scar.</v>

621
00:54:47.202 --> 00:54:49.067
<v anakin>You are in my very soul,</v>

622
00:54:49.162 --> 00:54:51.244
<v anakin>tormenting me.</v>

623
00:54:53.959 --> 00:54:57.918
<v anakin>What can I do? I will do anything that you ask.</v>

624
00:55:08.139 --> 00:55:12.007
<v anakin>If you are suffering as much as I am, please, tell me.</v>

625
00:55:13.603 --> 00:55:16.140
<v padme>I can't.</v>

626
00:55:16.773 --> 00:55:19.936
<v padme>We can't. It's just not possible.</v>

627
00:55:20.026 --> 00:55:23.063
<v anakin>Anything is possible, padme. Listen to me.</v>

628
00:55:23.446 --> 00:55:25.482
<v padme>No, you listen.</v>

629
00:55:25.574 --> 00:55:29.658
<v padme>We live in a real world. Come back to it.</v>

630
00:55:29.744 --> 00:55:33.157
<v padme>You're studying to become a jedi. I'm a senator.</v>

631
00:55:35.292 --> 00:55:37.783
<v padme>If you follow your thoughts through to conclusion,</v>

632
00:55:38.211 --> 00:55:41.078
<v padme>it'll take us to a place we cannot go,</v>

633
00:55:41.172 --> 00:55:43.834
<v padme>regardless of the way we feel about each other.</v>

634
00:55:44.259 --> 00:55:45.874
<v anakin>Then you do feel something.</v>

635
00:55:46.177 --> 00:55:48.964
<v padme>I will not let you give up your future for me.</v>

636
00:55:49.055 --> 00:55:51.296
<v anakin>You are asking me to be rational.</v>

637
00:55:52.100 --> 00:55:54.762
<v anakin>That is something I know I cannot do.</v>

638
00:55:55.145 --> 00:55:59.479
<v anakin>Believe me, I wish that I could just wish away my feelings,</v>

639
00:55:59.566 --> 00:56:01.431
<v anakin>but I can't.</v>

640
00:56:03.194 --> 00:56:05.276
<v padme>I will not give in to this.</v>

641
00:56:12.245 --> 00:56:14.236
<v anakin>Well, you know, it...</v>

642
00:56:14.331 --> 00:56:17.414
<v anakin>Wouldn't have to be that way.</v>

643
00:56:18.168 --> 00:56:20.534
<v anakin>We could keep it a secret.</v>

644
00:56:21.546 --> 00:56:23.912
<v padme>We'd be living a lie,</v>

645
00:56:24.007 --> 00:56:26.089
<v padme>one we couldn't keep even if we wanted to.</v>

646
00:56:27.302 --> 00:56:29.338
<v padme>I couldn't do that.</v>

647
00:56:29.429 --> 00:56:32.671
<v padme>Could you, Anakin? Could you live like that?</v>

648
00:56:34.559 --> 00:56:38.097
<v anakin>No. You're right.</v>

649
00:56:39.022 --> 00:56:41.388
<v anakin>It would destroy us.</v>

650
00:56:48.907 --> 00:56:52.445
Tell your council that the first battalions are ready.

651
00:56:52.535 --> 00:56:56.153
And remind them, if they need more troops,

652
00:56:56.247 --> 00:56:59.159
it will take more time to grow them.

653
00:56:59.250 --> 00:57:02.037
I won't forget, and thank you.
Thank you.

654
00:57:21.314 --> 00:57:24.977
Scramble code five to coruscant, care of the old folks' home!

655
00:57:31.366 --> 00:57:32.966
<v obi-wan>I have successfully made contact</v>

656
00:57:33.034 --> 00:57:34.615
with the prime minister of kamino.

657
00:57:35.120 --> 00:57:37.361
They are using a bounty hunter named jango fett

658
00:57:37.455 --> 00:57:38.786
to create a clone army.

659
00:57:39.207 --> 00:57:41.198
I have a strong feeling that this bounty hunter

660
00:57:41.292 --> 00:57:43.658
is the assassin we are looking for.

661
00:57:43.753 --> 00:57:45.272
Do you think these cloners are involved

662
00:57:45.296 --> 00:57:47.878
in the plot to assassinate senator Amidala?

663
00:57:48.049 --> 00:57:50.836
No, master. There appears to be no motive.

664
00:57:51.094 --> 00:57:53.927
<v yoda>Do not assume anything, Obi-Wan.</v>

665
00:57:54.347 --> 00:57:56.804
<v yoda>Clear your mind must be</v>

666
00:57:56.891 --> 00:58:01.260
<v yoda>if you are to discover the real villains behind this plot.</v>

667
00:58:01.354 --> 00:58:02.935
Yes, master.

668
00:58:03.023 --> 00:58:06.356
They say master sifo-dyas placed an order for a clone army

669
00:58:06.443 --> 00:58:10.231
at the request of the senate almost ten years ago.

670
00:58:12.657 --> 00:58:15.820
I was under the impression he was killed before that

671
00:58:16.202 --> 00:58:19.319
did the council ever authorize the creation of a clone army?

672
00:58:19.414 --> 00:58:21.325
No. Whoever placed that order

673
00:58:21.416 --> 00:58:23.748
did not have the authorization of the jedi council.

674
00:58:23.960 --> 00:58:28.203
<v yoda>Bring him here. Question him we will.</v>

675
00:58:28.506 --> 00:58:32.124
Yes, master. I will report back when I have him.

676
00:58:33.386 --> 00:58:37.345
<v yoda>Blind we are if creation of this clone army</v>

677
00:58:37.432 --> 00:58:39.297
<v yoda>we could not see.</v>

678
00:58:42.729 --> 00:58:44.560
I think it is time we informed the senate

679
00:58:44.647 --> 00:58:47.013
that our ability to use the force has diminished.

680
00:58:47.609 --> 00:58:52.148
Only the dark lord of the sith knows of our weakness.

681
00:58:52.238 --> 00:58:54.229
<v yoda>If informed the senate is,</v>

682
00:58:54.324 --> 00:58:57.111
<v yoda>multiply our adversaries will.</v>

683
00:58:58.411 --> 00:59:01.073
No.

684
00:59:01.164 --> 00:59:03.405
No.
<v shmi>Anakin! Help me!</v>

685
00:59:03.500 --> 00:59:04.740
Mom, no.

686
00:59:04.834 --> 00:59:07.792
Anakin! (Screaming) Don't.

687
00:59:08.880 --> 00:59:10.370
No.

688
00:59:13.176 --> 00:59:14.666
No.

689
00:59:34.280 --> 00:59:36.612
<v anakin>Don't go.</v>

690
00:59:38.368 --> 00:59:40.905
I don't want to disturb you.

691
00:59:41.663 --> 00:59:43.995
Your presence is soothing.

692
00:59:46.543 --> 00:59:49.034
You had another nightmare last night.

693
00:59:50.130 --> 00:59:52.621
Jedi don't have nightmares.

694
00:59:52.715 --> 00:59:54.751
I heard you.

695
00:59:59.848 --> 01:00:02.214
I saw my mother.

696
01:00:04.644 --> 01:00:07.260
She is suffering, padme.

697
01:00:09.482 --> 01:00:12.724
I saw her as clearly as I see you now.

698
01:00:23.913 --> 01:00:25.949
She is in pain.

699
01:00:27.500 --> 01:00:31.163
I know I'm disobeying my mandate to protect you, senator,

700
01:00:31.713 --> 01:00:33.795
but I have to go.

701
01:00:36.092 --> 01:00:38.128
I have to help her.

702
01:00:39.762 --> 01:00:41.753
I'll go with you.

703
01:00:42.473 --> 01:00:44.555
I'm sorry. I don't have a choice.

704
01:00:55.486 --> 01:00:57.147
<v boba-fett>Dad, look!</v>

705
01:02:16.651 --> 01:02:18.232
Oh, not good. (Grunts)

706
01:04:27.907 --> 01:04:30.649
Wait right there.
Okey-okey.

707
01:05:00.648 --> 01:05:02.513
(In english) Ani?

708
01:05:04.277 --> 01:05:05.767
Little ani?

709
01:05:12.535 --> 01:05:16.574
<v watto>You are ani! It is you! (Laughs)</v>

710
01:05:16.664 --> 01:05:20.703
<v watto>You sure sprouted, huh?</v>

711
01:05:20.793 --> 01:05:24.752
<v watto>A jedi! Whattaya know!</v>

712
01:05:25.339 --> 01:05:30.459
Hey, maybe you could help with some deadbeats who owe me a lot of money.

713
01:05:30.720 --> 01:05:32.176
<v anakin>(In english) My mother.</v>

714
01:05:32.763 --> 01:05:35.721
<v watto>Oh, yeah. Shmi. Uh...</v>

715
01:05:36.726 --> 01:05:39.559
<v watto>She's not mine-a no more-a. I sold her.</v>

716
01:05:39.645 --> 01:05:41.761
<v anakin>You sold her?</v>
<v watto>Years ago.</v>

717
01:05:41.898 --> 01:05:45.766
<v watto>Sorry, ani, but you know, business is business, huh?</v>

718
01:05:46.152 --> 01:05:49.644
<v watto>Yeah, I sold her to a moisture farmer named Lars.</v>

719
01:05:49.739 --> 01:05:52.071
<v watto>At least I think it was Lars.</v>

720
01:05:52.158 --> 01:05:55.650
<v watto>Believe it or not, I heard he freed her and married her!</v>

721
01:05:55.745 --> 01:05:59.203
<v watto>Can ya beat that? Yeah.</v>

722
01:06:00.791 --> 01:06:02.577
<v anakin>Do you know where they are now?</v>

723
01:06:03.461 --> 01:06:05.577
<v watto>Long way from here.</v>

724
01:06:05.671 --> 01:06:10.290
<v watto>Someplace over on the other side of mos eisley, I think.</v>

725
01:06:10.718 --> 01:06:12.458
<v anakin>I'd like to know.</v>

726
01:06:14.430 --> 01:06:16.671
<v watto>Sure. Absolutely!</v>

727
01:06:17.850 --> 01:06:19.932
<v watto>Let's go look at my records, huh?</v>

728
01:06:48.506 --> 01:06:51.418
Dad! I think we're being tracked!

729
01:06:51.717 --> 01:06:54.925
<v jango-fett>He must have put a homing device on our hull.</v>

730
01:06:55.012 --> 01:06:57.253
Hang on, son. We'll move into the asteroid field,

731
01:06:57.765 --> 01:07:00.552
and we'll have a couple of surprises for him,

732
01:07:11.737 --> 01:07:14.900
Seismic charges! Stand by.

733
01:07:40.224 --> 01:07:42.715
He doesn't seem to take a hint, this guy.

734
01:08:01.746 --> 01:08:02.746
Watch out!

735
01:08:22.391 --> 01:08:24.973
Get him, dad! Get him! Fire!

736
01:08:27.396 --> 01:08:29.603
<v obi-wan>Blast! This is why I hate flying!</v>

737
01:08:49.794 --> 01:08:53.207
We got him!
We'll just have to finish him.

738
01:09:19.365 --> 01:09:22.653
R4, prepare to jettison the spare part canisters.

739
01:09:27.039 --> 01:09:28.074
Fire them now!

740
01:09:41.095 --> 01:09:44.007
Well, we won't be seeing him again.

741
01:10:18.716 --> 01:10:20.581
Well, r4, I think we've waited long enough.

742
01:10:41.405 --> 01:10:44.989
There's an unusual concentration of federation ships over there, r4.

743
01:11:20.986 --> 01:11:22.942
<v padme>Stay with the ship, r2.</v>

744
01:11:35.793 --> 01:11:37.158
<v c-3po>Oh.</v>

745
01:11:38.003 --> 01:11:41.791
<v c-3po>Hello. How might I be of service? Lam c...</v>

746
01:11:41.882 --> 01:11:43.418
Ipo?

747
01:11:46.011 --> 01:11:47.547
The maker!

748
01:11:47.638 --> 01:11:50.675
Master ani! I knew you would return.

749
01:11:50.766 --> 01:11:54.179
<v c-3po>I knew it! And miss Padmé. Oh, my.</v>

750
01:11:54.270 --> 01:11:55.635
Hello, 3po.

751
01:11:56.230 --> 01:11:59.722
<v c-3po>Bless my circuits! I'm so pleased to see you both.</v>

752
01:12:00.109 --> 01:12:01.599
<v anakin>I've come to see my mother.</v>

753
01:12:01.902 --> 01:12:03.358
<v c-3po>Oh.</v>

754
01:12:03.445 --> 01:12:06.187
<v c-3po>I think perhaps we'd better go indoors.</v>

755
01:12:08.409 --> 01:12:13.153
Master Owen, might I present two most important visitors.

756
01:12:13.247 --> 01:12:15.488
<v anakin>I'm Anakin Skywalker.</v>

757
01:12:17.001 --> 01:12:20.164
<v owen>Owen Lars. This is my girlfriend, beru.</v>

758
01:12:20.254 --> 01:12:23.087
Hello. I'm Padmé.

759
01:12:23.173 --> 01:12:25.414
I guess I'm your stepbrother.

760
01:12:25.509 --> 01:12:28.421
<v owen>I had a feeling you might show up someday.</v>

761
01:12:29.680 --> 01:12:33.013
<v anakin>Is my mother here?</v>
<v role-man>No, she's not.</v>

762
01:12:34.018 --> 01:12:37.055
<v cliegg>Cliegg Lars. Shmi is my wife.</v>

763
01:12:38.898 --> 01:12:42.186
<v cliegg>We should go inside. We have a lot to talk about.</v>

764
01:12:49.491 --> 01:12:52.858
<v cliegg>It was just before dawn. They came out of nowhere.</v>

765
01:12:52.953 --> 01:12:56.741
<v cliegg>A hunting party of tusken raiders.</v>

766
01:12:56.832 --> 01:12:59.824
<v cliegg>Your mother had gone out early, like she always did,</v>

767
01:12:59.919 --> 01:13:03.411
<v cliegg>to pick mushrooms that grow on the vaporators.</v>

768
01:13:03.505 --> 01:13:08.169
<v cliegg>From the tracks, she was about halfway home</v>

769
01:13:08.260 --> 01:13:09.375
<v cliegg>when they took her.</v>

770
01:13:11.263 --> 01:13:13.003
<v cliegg>Those tuskens walk like men,</v>

771
01:13:13.098 --> 01:13:17.888
<v cliegg>but they're vicious, mindless monsters. Y y</v>

772
01:13:19.313 --> 01:13:22.726
<v cliegg>thirty of us went out after her. Four of us came back.</v>

773
01:13:23.484 --> 01:13:27.853
I'd be out there with them, but after I lost my leg,

774
01:13:28.280 --> 01:13:33.491
<v cliegg>I just couldn't ride anymore until I heal.</v>

775
01:13:34.203 --> 01:13:36.319
<v cliegg>I don't want to give up on her,</v>

776
01:13:36.705 --> 01:13:39.242
<v cliegg>but she's been gone a month.</v>

777
01:13:40.376 --> 01:13:43.459
<v cliegg>There's little hope she's lasted this long.</v>

778
01:13:47.132 --> 01:13:49.293
<v owen>Where are you going?</v>

779
01:13:49.385 --> 01:13:51.421
<v anakin>To find my mother.</v>

780
01:13:52.930 --> 01:13:56.218
<v cliegg>Your mother's dead, son. Accept it.</v>

781
01:14:17.871 --> 01:14:20.112
<v anakin>You're gonna have to stay here.</v>

782
01:14:20.874 --> 01:14:24.207
<v anakin>These are good people, padme. You'll be safe.</v>

783
01:14:24.294 --> 01:14:25.454
<v padme>Anakin...</v>

784
01:14:36.265 --> 01:14:38.301
<v anakin>I won't be long.</v>

785
01:16:27.417 --> 01:16:29.373
<v dooku>We must persuade the commerce guild</v>

786
01:16:29.461 --> 01:16:31.702
and the corporate alliance to sign the treaty.

787
01:16:32.005 --> 01:16:35.338
<v gunray>What about the senator from Naboo?</v>

788
01:16:35.425 --> 01:16:37.882
Is she dead yet?

789
01:16:37.970 --> 01:16:41.713
I am not signing your treaty until I have her head on my desk.

790
01:16:41.807 --> 01:16:44.389
<v dooku>I am a man of my word, viceroy.</v>

791
01:16:44.476 --> 01:16:47.684
<v role-alien>With these new battle droids we've built for you,</v>

792
01:16:47.771 --> 01:16:50.979
you'll have the finest army in the galaxy.

793
01:17:01.577 --> 01:17:03.238
<v dooku>As I explained to you earlier,</v>

794
01:17:03.328 --> 01:17:07.241
I am quite convinced that 10,000 more systems

795
01:17:07.332 --> 01:17:09.664
will rally to our cause with your support, gentlemen.

796
01:17:14.464 --> 01:17:19.925
The techno union army... (Electronic warbling)

797
01:17:20.012 --> 01:17:22.424
Is at your disposal, count.

798
01:17:23.182 --> 01:17:27.016
The banking clan will sign your treaty.

799
01:17:27.102 --> 01:17:28.808
<v dooku>Good. Very good.</v>

800
01:17:29.813 --> 01:17:33.397
Our friends from the trade federation have pledged their support,

801
01:17:33.483 --> 01:17:36.316
and when their battle droids are combined with yours,

802
01:17:36.403 --> 01:17:40.271
we shall have an army greater than any in the galaxy.

803
01:17:40.365 --> 01:17:44.233
The jedi will be overwhelmed.

804
01:17:44.453 --> 01:17:48.492
The Republic will agree to any demands we make.

805
01:18:47.140 --> 01:18:48.755
Mo om.

806
01:18:48.850 --> 01:18:50.886
<v anakin>Mom? Mom?</v>

807
01:18:52.938 --> 01:18:54.929
<v shmi>Ani?</v>

808
01:18:56.441 --> 01:19:00.810
<v shmi>Ani? Is it you?</v>

809
01:19:01.405 --> 01:19:05.148
<v anakin>I'm here, mom. You're safe.</v>

810
01:19:06.201 --> 01:19:08.032
Ani?

811
01:19:08.829 --> 01:19:10.820
Ani?

812
01:19:12.124 --> 01:19:14.285
<v shmi>You look so handsome.</v>

813
01:19:17.587 --> 01:19:19.794
<v shmi>My son.</v>

814
01:19:20.549 --> 01:19:23.131
<v shmi>My grown-up son.</v>

815
01:19:23.844 --> 01:19:26.506
<v shmi>I'm so proud of you, ani.</v>

816
01:19:26.930 --> 01:19:28.886
<v shmi>I missed you.</v>

817
01:19:30.892 --> 01:19:33.474
<v shmi>Now I am complete.</v>

818
01:19:38.984 --> 01:19:42.522
(Weakly) I lovey...

819
01:19:43.322 --> 01:19:46.439
<v anakin>Stay with me, mom. Everything...</v>

820
01:19:46.533 --> 01:19:48.649
<v shmi>I love...</v>

821
01:19:50.078 --> 01:19:52.865
<v shmi>I... I love...</v>

822
01:20:49.971 --> 01:20:54.590
(Qui-gon jinn's voice) Anakin! Anakin! No!

823
01:21:14.871 --> 01:21:16.077
What is it?

824
01:21:16.790 --> 01:21:20.749
Pain, suffering,

825
01:21:20.836 --> 01:21:23.202
death I feel.

826
01:21:27.592 --> 01:21:31.460
Something terrible has happened.

827
01:21:33.390 --> 01:21:38.305
Young Skywalker is in pain. Terrible pain.

828
01:21:43.650 --> 01:21:46.608
The transmitter is working, but we're not receiving a return signal.

829
01:21:46.695 --> 01:21:49.687
Coruscant's too far. R4, can you boost the power?

830
01:21:51.283 --> 01:21:53.444
We'll have to try something else.

831
01:21:55.912 --> 01:22:01.032
Maybe we can contact Anakin on Naboo. It's much closer.

832
01:22:03.086 --> 01:22:05.293
Anakin? Anakin, do you copy?

833
01:22:05.380 --> 01:22:08.338
This is Obi-Wan Kenobi. Anakin?

834
01:22:08.717 --> 01:22:10.708
He's not on Naboo, r4.

835
01:22:12.846 --> 01:22:14.837
I'm going to try and widen the range.

836
01:22:18.101 --> 01:22:19.762
I do hope nothing's happened to him.

837
01:22:27.319 --> 01:22:29.230
That's Anakin's tracking signal, all right,

838
01:22:30.030 --> 01:22:33.238
but it's coming from Tatooine.

839
01:22:33.325 --> 01:22:35.737
What in the blazes is he doing there?

840
01:22:35.827 --> 01:22:37.783
I told him to stay on Naboo.

841
01:22:41.583 --> 01:22:42.948
We haven't got much time.

842
01:22:43.043 --> 01:22:45.500
Anakin? Anakin, do you copy?

843
01:22:45.587 --> 01:22:47.669
This is Obi-Wan Kenobi.

844
01:22:55.722 --> 01:22:57.508
Retransmit this message...

845
01:22:59.309 --> 01:23:02.221
Anakin, do you copy? Anakin...

846
01:23:02.604 --> 01:23:04.560
My long-range has been knocked out.

847
01:23:04.648 --> 01:23:06.889
Retransmit this message to coruscant.

848
01:23:51.278 --> 01:23:53.769
<v padme>I brought you something.</v>

849
01:23:54.155 --> 01:23:55.986
<v padme>Are you hungry?</v>

850
01:23:57.576 --> 01:23:59.567
<v anakin>The shifter broke.</v>

851
01:24:01.580 --> 01:24:04.868
<v anakin>Life seems so much simpler when you're fixing things.</v>

852
01:24:06.876 --> 01:24:10.414
<v anakin>I'm good at fixing things. Always was.</v>

853
01:24:12.716 --> 01:24:14.707
<v anakin>But I couldn't...</v>

854
01:24:18.471 --> 01:24:20.712
<v anakin>Why'd she have to die?</v>

855
01:24:23.810 --> 01:24:25.801
<v anakin>Why couldn't I save her?</v>

856
01:24:25.895 --> 01:24:27.977
<v anakin>I know I could have!</v>

857
01:24:30.942 --> 01:24:33.684
<v padme>Sometimes there are things no one can fix.</v>

858
01:24:34.904 --> 01:24:38.112
<v padme>You're not all-powerful, ani.</v>
<v anakin>Well, I should be!</v>

859
01:24:40.660 --> 01:24:42.821
<v anakin>Someday I will be.</v>

860
01:24:42.912 --> 01:24:45.949
<v anakin>I will be the most powerful jedi ever!</v>

861
01:24:47.375 --> 01:24:49.206
<v anakin>I promise you.</v>

862
01:24:50.003 --> 01:24:52.585
<v anakin>I will even learn to stop people from dying.</v>

863
01:24:53.465 --> 01:24:54.796
Anakin.

864
01:24:56.051 --> 01:24:58.838
<v anakin>It's all Obi-Wan's fault!</v>

865
01:24:58.928 --> 01:25:01.965
<v anakin>He's jealous! He's holding me back!</v>

866
01:25:06.645 --> 01:25:08.931
<v padme>What's wrong, ani?</v>

867
01:25:14.069 --> 01:25:16.230
L

868
01:25:19.491 --> 01:25:21.652
<v anakin>I killed them.</v>

869
01:25:22.911 --> 01:25:25.027
<v anakin>I killed them all.</v>

870
01:25:26.956 --> 01:25:29.038
Th eyre dead.

871
01:25:29.125 --> 01:25:31.491
<v anakin>Every single one of them.</v>

872
01:25:33.129 --> 01:25:35.245
<v anakin>And not just the men,</v>

873
01:25:37.008 --> 01:25:39.215
<v anakin>but the women</v>

874
01:25:39.302 --> 01:25:41.338
<v anakin>and the children too.</v>

875
01:25:43.056 --> 01:25:47.015
<v anakin>They're like animals, and I slaughtered them like animals!</v>

876
01:25:48.353 --> 01:25:50.389
<v anakin>I hate them!</v>

877
01:26:08.123 --> 01:26:10.205
<v padme>To be angry is to be human.</v>

878
01:26:11.000 --> 01:26:12.991
<v anakin>I'm a jedi.</v>

879
01:26:13.086 --> 01:26:15.247
<v anakin>I know I'm better than this.</v>

880
01:26:29.018 --> 01:26:33.853
<v cliegg>I know wherever you are it's become a better place.</v>

881
01:26:33.940 --> 01:26:38.934
You were the most loving partner a man could ever have.

882
01:26:41.823 --> 01:26:44.030
Good-bye, my darling wife.

883
01:26:48.121 --> 01:26:49.986
And thank you.

884
01:27:17.150 --> 01:27:20.062
I wasn't strong enough to save you, mom,

885
01:27:22.530 --> 01:27:24.066
I wasn't strong enough.

886
01:27:28.328 --> 01:27:32.162
But I promise I won't fail again.

887
01:27:42.759 --> 01:27:44.920
I miss you...

888
01:27:46.387 --> 01:27:47.968
So much.

889
01:27:55.355 --> 01:27:57.812
R27? What are you doing here?

890
01:28:00.276 --> 01:28:04.895
It seems that he is carrying a message from an Obi-Wan Kenobi.

891
01:28:05.573 --> 01:28:09.191
Master ani, does that name mean anything to you?

892
01:28:11.162 --> 01:28:13.869
<v obi-wan>Anakin, my long-range transmitter has been knocked out</v>

893
01:28:13.957 --> 01:28:16.198
<v obi-wan>retransmit this message to coruscant.</v>

894
01:28:20.296 --> 01:28:22.582
<v obi-wan>I have tracked the bounty hunter, jango fett,</v>

895
01:28:22.674 --> 01:28:25.086
<v obi-wan>lo the droid foundries on geonosis.</v>

896
01:28:25.176 --> 01:28:28.464
The trade federation is to take delivery of a droid army here,

897
01:28:28.555 --> 01:28:30.887
and it is clear that viceroy gunray

898
01:28:30.974 --> 01:28:34.432
is behind the assassination attempts on senator Amidala.

899
01:28:34.519 --> 01:28:36.350
The commerce guilds and the corporate alliance

900
01:28:36.437 --> 01:28:40.100
<v obi-wan>have both pledged their armies to count dooku and are forming a...</v>

901
01:28:40.191 --> 01:28:42.432
Wait wait

902
01:28:53.746 --> 01:28:58.080
More happening on geonosis, I feel, than has been revealed.

903
01:28:58.167 --> 01:29:00.078
I agree.

904
01:29:00.169 --> 01:29:03.286
<v mace-windu>Anakin, we will deal with count dooku.</v>

905
01:29:03.381 --> 01:29:07.294
<v mace-windu>The mast important thing for you is to stay where you are.</v>

906
01:29:07.635 --> 01:29:10.047
<v mace-windu>Protect the senator at all costs.</v>

907
01:29:10.346 --> 01:29:13.258
<v mace-windu>That is your first priority.</v>

908
01:29:14.225 --> 01:29:16.181
<v anakin>Understood, master.</v>

909
01:29:16.269 --> 01:29:17.788
<v padme>They'll never get there in time to save him.</v>

910
01:29:17.812 --> 01:29:21.646
<v padme>They have to come halfway across the galaxy. Look.</v>

911
01:29:23.401 --> 01:29:25.983
<v padme>Geonosis is less than a parsec away.</v>

912
01:29:26.279 --> 01:29:28.315
<v anakin>If he's still alive.</v>

913
01:29:29.699 --> 01:29:32.156
<v padme>Ani, are you just gonna sit here and let him die?</v>

914
01:29:32.243 --> 01:29:33.824
<v padme>He's your friend, your mentor. He's...</v>

915
01:29:33.912 --> 01:29:35.072
<v anakin>He's like my father!</v>

916
01:29:36.247 --> 01:29:40.160
<v anakin>But you heard master windu. He gave me strict orders to stay here!</v>

917
01:29:40.543 --> 01:29:43.205
<v padme>He gave you strict orders to protect me,</v>

918
01:29:43.296 --> 01:29:45.833
<v padme>and I'm going to help Obi-Wan.</v>

919
01:29:46.966 --> 01:29:50.379
<v padme>If you plan to protect me, you'll just have to come along.</v>

920
01:29:54.307 --> 01:29:58.175
I'm not worried, r2. It's just I've never flown before.

921
01:30:08.112 --> 01:30:09.673
The commerce guilds are preparing for war.

922
01:30:09.697 --> 01:30:10.982
There can be no doubt of that.

923
01:30:11.074 --> 01:30:12.939
Count dooku must have made a treaty with them.

924
01:30:19.457 --> 01:30:22.665
Unfortunately, the debate is not over.

925
01:30:22.752 --> 01:30:27.086
The senate will never approve the use of clones before the separatists attack.

926
01:30:27.173 --> 01:30:28.879
<v amedda>This is a crisis.</v>

927
01:30:28.967 --> 01:30:31.959
<v amedda>The senate must vote the chancellor emergency powers.</v>

928
01:30:32.637 --> 01:30:35.800
<v amedda>He can then approve the creation of an army.</v>

929
01:30:35.890 --> 01:30:38.176
<v organa>But what senator would have the courage</v>

930
01:30:38.267 --> 01:30:40.758
<v organa>to propose such a radical amendment?</v>

931
01:30:41.187 --> 01:30:45.351
<v amedda>If only senator Amidala were here.</v>

932
01:30:46.609 --> 01:30:47.689
<v palpatine>Hmm.</v>

933
01:31:06.254 --> 01:31:07.835
<v obi-wan>Traitor.</v>

934
01:31:08.715 --> 01:31:12.082
<v dooku>Oh, no, my friend. This is a mistake, a terrible mistake.</v>

935
01:31:12.176 --> 01:31:14.167
<v dooku>They have gone too far. This is madness.</v>

936
01:31:14.345 --> 01:31:16.802
<v obi-wan>I thought you were the leader here, dooku.</v>

937
01:31:17.223 --> 01:31:19.509
<v dooku>This had nothing to do with me, I assure you.</v>

938
01:31:20.101 --> 01:31:23.013
<v dooku>I will petition immediately to have you set free.</v>

939
01:31:23.104 --> 01:31:26.688
<v obi-wan>Well, I hope it doesn't take too long. I have work to do.</v>

940
01:31:27.275 --> 01:31:30.733
<v dooku>May I ask why a jedi knight</v>

941
01:31:30.820 --> 01:31:33.186
<v dooku>is all the way out here on geonosis?</v>

942
01:31:33.781 --> 01:31:36.193
<v obi-wan>I've been tracking a bounty hunter named jango fett.</v>

943
01:31:36.284 --> 01:31:37.820
<v obi-wan>Do you know him?</v>

944
01:31:37.910 --> 01:31:40.822
<v dooku>There are no bounty hunters here that I am aware of.</v>

945
01:31:40.913 --> 01:31:42.653
<v dooku>The geonosians don't trust them.</v>

946
01:31:42.749 --> 01:31:45.957
<v obi-wan>Who can blame them? But he is here, I can assure you.</v>

947
01:31:47.003 --> 01:31:51.497
<v dooku>It's a great pity that our paths have never crossed before, Obi-Wan.</v>

948
01:31:52.216 --> 01:31:54.753
<v dooku>Qui-gon always spoke very highly of you.</v>

949
01:31:59.182 --> 01:32:01.514
<v dooku>I wish he were still alive.</v>

950
01:32:02.769 --> 01:32:05.351
<v dooku>I could use his help right now.</v>

951
01:32:06.272 --> 01:32:08.228
<v obi-wan>Qui-gon jinn would never join you.</v>

952
01:32:10.318 --> 01:32:13.185
<v dooku>Don't be so sure, my young jedi.</v>

953
01:32:13.279 --> 01:32:16.316
<v dooku>You forget that he was once my apprentice,</v>

954
01:32:16.407 --> 01:32:18.614
<v dooku>just as you were once his.</v>

955
01:32:19.368 --> 01:32:21.324
<v dooku>He knew all about the corruption in the senate,</v>

956
01:32:21.412 --> 01:32:22.931
<v dooku>but he would never have gone along with it</v>

957
01:32:22.955 --> 01:32:24.661
<v dooku>if he had learned the truth as I have.</v>

958
01:32:24.957 --> 01:32:27.448
The truth? =the truth.

959
01:32:33.883 --> 01:32:35.339
<v dooku>What if I told you that the Republic</v>

960
01:32:35.426 --> 01:32:38.964
<v dooku>was now under the control of the dark lord of the sith?</v>

961
01:32:39.055 --> 01:32:42.343
<v obi-wan>No, that's not possible. The jedi would be aware of it.</v>

962
01:32:42.809 --> 01:32:47.428
<v dooku>The dark side of the force has clouded their vision, my friend.</v>

963
01:32:47.522 --> 01:32:50.355
<v dooku>Hundreds of senators are now under the influence</v>

964
01:32:50.441 --> 01:32:54.810
<v dooku>of a sith lord called darth Sidious.</v>

965
01:32:55.863 --> 01:32:57.774
<v obi-wan>I don't believe you.</v>

966
01:32:57.865 --> 01:32:59.901
<v dooku>The viceroy of the trade federation</v>

967
01:32:59.992 --> 01:33:04.406
<v dooku>was once in league with this darth Sidious,</v>

968
01:33:04.664 --> 01:33:08.373
<v dooku>but he was betrayed ten years ago by the dark lord.</v>

969
01:33:08.459 --> 01:33:11.496
<v dooku>He came to me for help. He told me everything.</v>

970
01:33:13.381 --> 01:33:16.043
<v dooku>You must join me, Obi-Wan,</v>

971
01:33:16.509 --> 01:33:20.798
<v dooku>and together we will destroy the sith!</v>

972
01:33:22.306 --> 01:33:24.968
<v obi-wan>I will never join you, dooku.</v>

973
01:33:34.235 --> 01:33:37.272
<v dooku>It may be difficult to secure your release.</v>

974
01:33:44.871 --> 01:33:48.034
<v jar-jar>It's-a clear desa separatists made a pact</v>

975
01:33:48.124 --> 01:33:50.410
<v jar-jar>wesa desa federation du trade.</v>

976
01:33:50.501 --> 01:33:54.835
<v jar-jar>Senators, dellow felagates...</v>

977
01:33:54.922 --> 01:33:59.416
<v jar-jar>In response to this direct threat to the Republic,</v>

978
01:34:00.052 --> 01:34:03.169
<v jar-jar>mesa propose that the senate</v>

979
01:34:03.347 --> 01:34:06.510
<v jar-jar>give immediately emergency powers</v>

980
01:34:06.601 --> 01:34:09.559
<v jar-jar>to the supreme chancellor.</v>

981
01:34:11.480 --> 01:34:15.814
(Chanting) Palpatine! Palpatine! Palpatine!

982
01:34:19.071 --> 01:34:22.359
<v amedda>Order! We shall have order!</v>

983
01:34:23.701 --> 01:34:26.864
<v palpatine>It is with great reluctance</v>

984
01:34:26.954 --> 01:34:29.445
<v palpatine>that I have agreed to this calling.</v>

985
01:34:30.499 --> 01:34:34.663
<v palpatine>I love democracy. I love the Republic.</v>

986
01:34:36.088 --> 01:34:37.794
<v palpatine>The power you give me,</v>

987
01:34:38.007 --> 01:34:42.501
<v palpatine>I will lay down when this crisis has abated.</v>

988
01:34:47.225 --> 01:34:51.514
<v palpatine>And as my first act with this new authority,</v>

989
01:34:52.146 --> 01:34:56.264
<v palpatine>I will create a grand army of the Republic</v>

990
01:34:56.943 --> 01:35:00.777
<v palpatine>to counter the increasing threats of the separatists.</v>

991
01:35:01.322 --> 01:35:04.029
<v mace-windu>It is done, then. Hmm.</v>

992
01:35:08.496 --> 01:35:12.409
<v mace-windu>I will take what jedi we have left and go to geonosis and help Obi-Wan,</v>

993
01:35:12.500 --> 01:35:17.415
<v yoda>visit I will the cloners on kamino,</v>

994
01:35:17.505 --> 01:35:21.339
<v yoda>and see this army they have created for the Republic.</v>

995
01:35:41.487 --> 01:35:43.694
See those columns of steam straight ahead?

996
01:35:43.781 --> 01:35:45.817
They're exhaust vents of some type.

997
01:35:46.534 --> 01:35:48.115
That'll do.

998
01:35:57.962 --> 01:36:01.250
Look, whatever happens out there, follow my lead.

999
01:36:01.340 --> 01:36:03.547
I'm not interested in getting into a war here.

1000
01:36:03.634 --> 01:36:04.714
As a member of the senate,

1001
01:36:04.802 --> 01:36:07.635
maybe I can find a diplomatic solution to this mess.

1002
01:36:08.556 --> 01:36:12.549
Don't worry. I've given up trying to argue with you.

1003
01:36:18.107 --> 01:36:21.190
My obtuse little friend, if they had needed our help,

1004
01:36:21.277 --> 01:36:23.268
they would have asked for it.

1005
01:36:23.362 --> 01:36:26.604
You obviously have a great deal to learn about human behavior.

1006
01:36:52.433 --> 01:36:53.433
<v dooku>For a mechanic,</v>

1007
01:36:53.517 --> 01:36:55.599
you seem to do an excessive amount of thinking.

1008
01:36:57.730 --> 01:37:00.267
I am programmed to understand humans!

1009
01:37:03.819 --> 01:37:05.559
<v padme>"What does that mean?"</v>

1010
01:37:05.654 --> 01:37:08.566
That means I am in charge here!

1011
01:37:08.657 --> 01:37:11.649
Where are you going now? You don't know what's out there.

1012
01:37:11.744 --> 01:37:15.236
Have you no sense at all? Idiot!

1013
01:37:17.917 --> 01:37:19.623
Please wait.

1014
01:37:20.669 --> 01:37:22.455
Do you know where you're going?

1015
01:37:34.809 --> 01:37:36.470
Wait.

1016
01:37:45.319 --> 01:37:47.184
<v c-3po>Oh, my...</v>

1017
01:37:57.623 --> 01:37:59.329
Padmél

1018
01:38:52.261 --> 01:38:55.879
Oh, my goodness! Shut me down!

1019
01:38:56.724 --> 01:38:58.715
Machines making machines.

1020
01:38:59.685 --> 01:39:01.016
How perverse. Oh

1021
01:39:02.021 --> 01:39:05.434
calm down, r2. I almost fell.

1022
01:39:05.649 --> 01:39:07.355
You'll get your chance... (Screams)

1023
01:39:09.778 --> 01:39:11.314
I'm scrap.

1024
01:39:12.740 --> 01:39:14.696
It's a nightmare!

1025
01:39:16.952 --> 01:39:18.658
<v gunray>I want to go home!</v>

1026
01:39:20.664 --> 01:39:22.154
What did I do to deserve this?

1027
01:40:01.914 --> 01:40:04.280
I wonder what happened to poor little r2,

1028
01:40:04.625 --> 01:40:06.707
he's always getting himself into trouble.

1029
01:40:08.420 --> 01:40:09.705
Oh, nol

1030
01:40:19.557 --> 01:40:20.557
<v role-droid>Uh-oh.</v>

1031
01:40:24.895 --> 01:40:26.510
I'm so confused.

1032
01:42:22.304 --> 01:42:23.840
Not again.

1033
01:42:24.723 --> 01:42:26.429
Obi-Wan's gonna kill me.

1034
01:42:35.359 --> 01:42:38.522
<v jango-fett>Don't move, jedi! Take him away.</v>

1035
01:42:57.923 --> 01:42:59.538
<v anakin>Don't be afraid.</v>

1036
01:43:00.926 --> 01:43:03.292
<v padme>I'm not afraid to die.</v>

1037
01:43:08.016 --> 01:43:12.180
<v padme>I've been dying a little bit each day since you came back into my life.</v>

1038
01:43:13.772 --> 01:43:15.933
<v anakin>What are you talking about?</v>

1039
01:43:17.192 --> 01:43:19.683
<v padme>I love you.</v>

1040
01:43:23.323 --> 01:43:25.314
<v anakin>You love me?</v>

1041
01:43:29.872 --> 01:43:33.160
<v anakin>I thought that we had decided not to fall in love,</v>

1042
01:43:34.918 --> 01:43:38.661
<v anakin>that we would be forced to live a lie</v>

1043
01:43:38.922 --> 01:43:41.834
<v anakin>and that it would destroy our lives.</v>

1044
01:43:42.426 --> 01:43:45.509
<v padme>I think our lives are about to be destroyed anyway.</v>

1045
01:43:49.808 --> 01:43:51.389
<v padme>I truly,</v>

1046
01:43:52.770 --> 01:43:55.728
<v padme>deeply love you,</v>

1047
01:43:56.815 --> 01:43:59.932
<v padme>and before we die, I want you to know.</v>

1048
01:44:56.500 --> 01:44:58.957
<v obi-wan>I was beginning to wonder if you'd got my message.</v>

1049
01:44:59.044 --> 01:45:02.628
<v anakin>I retransmitted it just as you had requested, master.</v>

1050
01:45:04.299 --> 01:45:06.210
<v anakin>Then we decided to come and rescue you.</v>

1051
01:45:07.678 --> 01:45:08.918
<v obi-wan>Good job.</v>

1052
01:46:04.902 --> 01:46:07.609
<v anakin>I've got a bad feeling about this.</v>

1053
01:46:33.221 --> 01:46:35.462
<v anakin>Just relax. Concentrate. What about Padmé?</v>

1054
01:46:35.891 --> 01:46:37.802
<v obi-wan>She seems to be on top of things.</v>

1055
01:49:03.955 --> 01:49:04.990
<v anakin>Jump!</v>

1056
01:49:10.629 --> 01:49:11.629
Hyah!

1057
01:49:29.231 --> 01:49:34.442
<v gunray>This isn't how it's supposed to be! Jango! Finish her off!</v>

1058
01:49:34.694 --> 01:49:38.937
<v dooku>Patience, viceroy, Patience. She will die.</v>

1059
01:50:08.436 --> 01:50:12.520
<v dooku>Master windu, how pleasant of you to join us.</v>

1060
01:50:12.607 --> 01:50:14.472
<v mace-windu>This party's over.</v>

1061
01:50:28.498 --> 01:50:33.162
<v dooku>Brave but foolish, my old jedi friend.</v>

1062
01:50:33.253 --> 01:50:37.337
You're impossibly outnumbered. =I don't think so.

1063
01:50:37.757 --> 01:50:38.792
<v dooku>We'll see.</v>

1064
01:51:17.380 --> 01:51:20.122
<v role-battle-droid>My legs aren't moving. I must need maintenance.</v>

1065
01:51:59.506 --> 01:52:02.293
<v c-3po>What's all this noise? A battle!</v>

1066
01:52:02.509 --> 01:52:04.500
<v c-3po>There's been some terrible mistake!</v>

1067
01:52:04.594 --> 01:52:07.381
<v c-3po>I'm programmed for etiquette, not destruction!</v>

1068
01:53:35.435 --> 01:53:38.598
<v c-3po>Die, jedi dogs! What did I say?</v>

1069
01:53:48.198 --> 01:53:51.110
<v c-3po>Oh, dear. I'm terribly sorry about all this.</v>

1070
01:53:56.831 --> 01:53:59.664
Excuse me. I'm trapped. I can't get up.

1071
01:54:13.723 --> 01:54:15.384
<v anakin>You call this a diplomatic solution?</v>

1072
01:54:15.475 --> 01:54:17.636
<v padme>No, I call it aggressive negotiations.</v>

1073
01:54:22.690 --> 01:54:23.690
<v role-battle-droid>Uh-oh.</v>

1074
01:54:23.775 --> 01:54:24.890
<v role-battle-droid>Roger, Roger.</v>

1075
01:54:43.503 --> 01:54:45.243
<v c-3po>R2, what are you doing here?</v>

1076
01:54:48.591 --> 01:54:51.003
What are you doing? Stop that!

1077
01:54:51.094 --> 01:54:53.801
You're going to strain something. My neck!

1078
01:54:56.641 --> 01:54:59.678
Now where are you taking me? This is such a drag.

1079
01:55:05.358 --> 01:55:06.643
I'm quite beside myself.

1080
01:55:15.785 --> 01:55:18.697
R2, please be careful! You're singeing my circuits!

1081
01:55:20.165 --> 01:55:22.781
Yes, but is my head on straight?

1082
01:55:45.440 --> 01:55:49.399
<v dooku>Master windu, you have fought gallantly,</v>

1083
01:55:50.487 --> 01:55:55.732
<v dooku>worthy of recognition in the archives of the jedi order.</v>

1084
01:55:56.743 --> 01:56:00.076
<v dooku>Now it is finished.</v>

1085
01:56:01.748 --> 01:56:06.117
<v dooku>Surrender, and your lives will be spared.</v>

1086
01:56:06.669 --> 01:56:10.582
<v mace-windu>We will not be hostages to be bartered, dooku!</v>

1087
01:56:10.673 --> 01:56:14.837
<v dooku>Then, I'm sorry, old friend.</v>

1088
01:56:26.481 --> 01:56:27.891
<v padme>Look!</v>

1089
01:56:38.535 --> 01:56:42.904
<v yoda>Around the survivors a perimeter create.</v>

1090
01:57:39.345 --> 01:57:42.508
<v c-3po>I've had the most peculiar dream.</v>

1091
01:57:53.109 --> 01:57:54.974
<v yoda>If dooku escapes,</v>

1092
01:57:55.403 --> 01:57:58.816
<v yoda>rally more systems to his cause he will.</v>

1093
01:58:03.620 --> 01:58:04.905
<v obi-wan>Hold on!</v>

1094
01:58:10.001 --> 01:58:11.957
Aim right above the fuel cells!

1095
01:58:18.801 --> 01:58:21.042
Good call, my young padawan.

1096
01:58:34.442 --> 01:58:36.854
<v gunray>The jedi have amassed a huge army.</v>

1097
01:58:37.195 --> 01:58:39.026
That doesn't seem possible.

1098
01:58:39.113 --> 01:58:41.729
How could the jedi come up with an army so quickly?

1099
01:58:41.824 --> 01:58:45.863
We must send all available droids into battle.

1100
01:58:45.953 --> 01:58:47.193
There are too many.

1101
01:58:59.133 --> 01:59:02.170
Pilot, land in that assembly areal
Yes, sir.

1102
01:59:11.938 --> 01:59:15.726
Sir, I have five special commando units awaiting your orders, sir.

1103
01:59:17.110 --> 01:59:20.694
<v yoda>To the forward command center take me.</v>

1104
01:59:43.761 --> 01:59:46.093
Attack those federation starships! Quickly!

1105
01:59:57.191 --> 02:00:00.979
Master Yoda, all forward positions are advancing.

1106
02:00:01.404 --> 02:00:05.443
Very good. Very good.

1107
02:00:33.186 --> 02:00:35.552
<v gunray>This is not looking good at all!</v>

1108
02:00:37.023 --> 02:00:40.311
We must get the starships back into space.

1109
02:00:47.450 --> 02:00:49.156
My master will never allow the Republic

1110
02:00:49.243 --> 02:00:50.574
to get away with this treachery.

1111
02:01:10.181 --> 02:01:12.547
I will take the designs with me to coruscant.

1112
02:01:13.684 --> 02:01:17.097
They will be much safer there with my master.

1113
02:02:11.284 --> 02:02:15.448
Concentrate all your fire on the nearest starship.

1114
02:02:16.205 --> 02:02:17.411
Yes, sir.

1115
02:02:18.291 --> 02:02:21.033
Move all quadrants to sector 5-1-5.

1116
02:03:02.043 --> 02:03:03.043
<v obi-wan>Look over there!</v>

1117
02:03:06.464 --> 02:03:08.705
<v anakin>It's dooku! Shoot him down!</v>

1118
02:03:09.300 --> 02:03:10.915
We're out of rockets, sir.

1119
02:03:11.135 --> 02:03:13.842
Follow him! “We're gonna need some help!

1120
02:03:37.161 --> 02:03:38.321
<v anakin>Padmé!</v>

1121
02:03:41.791 --> 02:03:44.157
<v anakin>Put the ship down!</v>
<v obi-wan>Anakin!</v>

1122
02:03:44.251 --> 02:03:48.039
<v obi-wan>Don't let your personal feelings get in the way! Follow that speeder!</v>

1123
02:03:54.095 --> 02:03:56.211
Lower the ship!
I can't take dooku alone!

1124
02:03:56.305 --> 02:04:00.014
I need you! If we catch him, we can end this war right now!

1125
02:04:00.351 --> 02:04:03.138
<v obi-wan>We have a job to do!</v>
I don't care! Put the ship down!

1126
02:04:03.229 --> 02:04:05.436
You will be expelled from the jedi order!

1127
02:04:05.523 --> 02:04:08.390
I can't leave her!
Come to your senses!

1128
02:04:08.484 --> 02:04:11.396
What do you think padme would do were she in your position?

1129
02:04:16.075 --> 02:04:17.440
She would do her duty.

1130
02:04:27.086 --> 02:04:29.122
The droid army is in full retreat.

1131
02:04:29.213 --> 02:04:32.330
Well done, commander. Bring me a ship.

1132
02:04:59.368 --> 02:05:02.326
<v anakin>You're gonna pay for all the jedi that you killed today, dooku.</v>

1133
02:05:02.747 --> 02:05:04.433
We'll take him together. Go in slowly on the left.

1134
02:05:04.457 --> 02:05:05.537
<v anakin>I'm taking him now!</v>

1135
02:05:05.624 --> 02:05:08.036
<v obi-wan>No, Anakin! No! No!</v>

1136
02:05:14.258 --> 02:05:18.001
<v dooku>As you see, my jedi powers are far beyond yours.</v>

1137
02:05:18.095 --> 02:05:20.586
<v dooku>Now back down.</v>

1138
02:05:25.895 --> 02:05:27.726
<v obi-wan>I don't think so.</v>

1139
02:05:40.576 --> 02:05:43.283
<v dooku>Master Kenobi, you disappoint me.</v>

1140
02:05:43.370 --> 02:05:46.487
<v dooku>Yoda holds you in such high esteem.</v>

1141
02:05:50.044 --> 02:05:51.250
<v dooku>Surely you can do better.</v>

1142
02:06:02.431 --> 02:06:05.047
Are you all right'? Uh-huh.

1143
02:06:07.103 --> 02:06:09.139
We'd better get back to the forward command center.

1144
02:06:09.230 --> 02:06:10.845
<v padme>No. No.</v>

1145
02:06:11.398 --> 02:06:14.356
<v padme>Gather what troops you can. We've got to get to that hangar.</v>

1146
02:06:14.443 --> 02:06:17.606
<v padme>Get a transport. Hurry!</v>
Right away.

1147
02:06:43.430 --> 02:06:44.670
<v dooku>Brave of you, boy.</v>

1148
02:06:46.308 --> 02:06:48.388
<v dooku>But I would have thought you had learned your lesson.</v>

1149
02:06:48.435 --> 02:06:50.721
<v anakin>I am a slow learner. Anakin!</v>

1150
02:07:52.625 --> 02:07:57.210
<v dooku>Master Yoda.</v>
<v yoda>Count dooku.</v>

1151
02:07:57.588 --> 02:08:00.955
<v dooku>You have interfered with our affairs for the last time.</v>

1152
02:08:31.497 --> 02:08:35.035
<v yoda>Powerful you have become, dooku.</v>

1153
02:08:35.376 --> 02:08:38.539
<v yoda>The dark side I sense in you.</v>

1154
02:08:38.879 --> 02:08:41.746
<v dooku>I've become more powerful than any jedi.</v>

1155
02:08:43.634 --> 02:08:44.874
<v dooku>Even you.</v>

1156
02:08:59.441 --> 02:09:02.558
<v yoda>Much to learn you still have.</v>

1157
02:09:03.195 --> 02:09:06.028
<v dooku>It is obvious that this contest cannot be decided</v>

1158
02:09:06.115 --> 02:09:09.323
<v dooku>by our knowledge of the force...</v>

1159
02:09:10.035 --> 02:09:12.868
<v dooku>Out by our skills with a lightsaber.</v>

1160
02:09:54.455 --> 02:09:57.868
<v yoda>Fought well you have, my old padawan.</v>

1161
02:09:58.083 --> 02:09:59.914
<v dooku>This is just the beginning.</v>

1162
02:11:14.701 --> 02:11:16.487
<v padme>Anakin!</v>

1163
02:12:32.738 --> 02:12:35.650
<v dooku>The force is with us, master Sidious.</v>

1164
02:12:35.741 --> 02:12:38.608
<v sidious>Welcome home, lord tyranus.</v>

1165
02:12:40.370 --> 02:12:42.907
<v sidious>You have done well.</v>

1166
02:12:42.998 --> 02:12:45.034
<v dooku>I have good news for you, my lord.</v>

1167
02:12:46.710 --> 02:12:50.077
<v dooku>The war has begun. Excellent.</v>

1168
02:12:50.172 --> 02:12:52.879
<v sidious>Everything is going as planned.</v>

1169
02:13:03.060 --> 02:13:04.704
<v obi-wan>Do you believe what count dooku said</v>

1170
02:13:04.728 --> 02:13:07.470
<v obi-wan>about Sidious controlling the senate?</v>

1171
02:13:07.564 --> 02:13:09.725
<v obi-wan>It doesn't feel right.</v>

1172
02:13:09.816 --> 02:13:12.853
<v yoda>Joined the dark side dooku has.</v>

1173
02:13:14.279 --> 02:13:15.860
<v yoda>Lies, deceit,</v>

1174
02:13:16.365 --> 02:13:19.698
<v yoda>creating mistrust are his ways now.</v>

1175
02:13:19.785 --> 02:13:24.404
<v mace-windu>Nevertheless, I feel we should keep a closer eye on the senate.</v>

1176
02:13:24.498 --> 02:13:26.534
<v yoda>I agree.</v>

1177
02:13:27.793 --> 02:13:29.784
<v mace-windu>Where is your apprentice?</v>

1178
02:13:30.003 --> 02:13:33.916
<v obi-wan>On his way to Naboo, escorting senator Amidala home.</v>

1179
02:13:35.342 --> 02:13:38.709
<v obi-wan>I have to admit that without the clones, it would not have been a victory.</v>

1180
02:13:38.804 --> 02:13:40.886
<v yoda>Victory?</v>

1181
02:13:41.807 --> 02:13:44.389
<v yoda>Victory, you say?</v>

1182
02:13:44.476 --> 02:13:48.219
<v yoda>Master Obi-Wan, not victory.</v>

1183
02:13:49.731 --> 02:13:53.064
<v yoda>The shroud of the dark side has fallen.</v>

1184
02:13:54.653 --> 02:13:58.737
<v yoda>Begun the clone war has.</v>
